<title>INDIA: India RBI says cut off at 4.9 pct in repo auction.</title>
<headline>India RBI says cut off at 4.9 pct in repo auction.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Reserve Bank of India (RBI) said on Tuesday it set the cut-off at 4.90 percent in the three-day repo auction.</p>
<p>--Bombay newsroom +91-22-265-9000</p>
